# The storefront page and the board page.
# The file name is the key PREFIX: an entry here resolves as ziggfreedcommon.commerce.<key>.
#
# CHROME ONLY. A shop's own name and every offer or contract title are CONTENT keys: they belong to
# the lang file of whoever authored the content, not here. Nothing in this file names a currency, a
# price or any other balance figure.
#
# The band and shelf labels at the bottom are chrome too: they are one WORD for a common band or a
# common shelf, carrying nothing about what anything costs or is worth. They are defaults, and they
# are the last rung of the ladder - a board or a storefront that writes its own Text for a band or a
# category wins, and so does a mod that ships the same key in its own lang file.

